<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibhiri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">2 vaKorinde</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro ku2 vaKorinde</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 VaKorinde</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 VaK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba raPhauro roChipiri</para>
  <para style="mt1">kuVaKorinde</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">2 VaKorinde ridonyohwa naPhauro kumakore 55 kusvika 56 sure kwokuberekewa kwaKhirisitu (2 VaKorinde 1:1) Iri ndiro tsamba rochipiri pamatsamba mairi yatinayo yadonyohwa naPhauro kukherekhe yokuKorinde. Ana mazvikokota vodzidzo vanotenda kuti Phauro wanga wambonyorera vaKorinde tsamba ridochechema. Hatinai zvidoteedzehwa kunyorewa kubva patsamba rakarero raanoreva mundima 2 VaKorinde 2:3—4:2 VaKorinde rinogona kunge ridonyohwa Phauro paanga ari kuMesodhoniya (2 VaKorinde 2:13)</para>
  <para style="ip">2 VaKorinde ridotsarukana pakuti itsamba rinochokuita nomanzviro yomunhu pachake. Phauro anobiritsa mufaro wache nokuda kwozvidorehwa naTito pamusoro pozvidonaka zvokherekhe yokuKorinde. Mutsamba iri, tinowana dzidziso nomupfupfunyungwe wayene wese pamusoro pokupa kuri mumaonero yoChitenderano Chitsva, muzvikamu izvo Phauro anopasa rairo yokuti mari iunganidziwe kuitira kuti idzotohwa ichiendesewa kobatsira vatendi vokuJerusarema (2 VaKorinde 8:1—9:15) Zvinenge kuti nhumwa dzomabhwodo dzanga dzabva kunze kwokherekhe dzanga dzichishandisa kupanduka kwovamwe vanhu vomukherekhe kuhwisana naPhauro kuti dzizvisumudzire. Dziisa kupokana pamusoro poukuru hwaPhauro, zvinova izvo zvacho zvingadaro zvidomupasa kudzika muthadzi pasimba rache rokuva nhumwa waJesu Khirisitu kumhera kwobhuku rochipiri kuvaKorinde.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongedzehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga tsamba rache nokukwazisa kherekhe (2 VaKorinde 1:1-7)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera Phauro anotaura nezvokusandura urongwa hwohwendo hwache uye anobatawo hwenye hwaanga atambira kubva kwavari pamusoro pomhinduro yavo pastamba rache rokuthanga (2 VaKorinde 1:8—7:16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Musure mozvakarezvo Phauro anowidzira nyaya yokuunganidza mari yovatendi vokuJerusarema (2 VaKorinde 8:1—9:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pakupedzisira Phauro anopereka dziviriro pamusoro pounhumwa hwache nokuyambira kuri pamusoro pokubvakacha kwache kwaidzotevera (2 VaKorinde 10:1—13:10)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Inini Phauro nhumwa waKhirisitu Jesu nokuda kwaMwari, naTimoti hama yedu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Ndiri kunyora kukherekhe yaMwari iri muguta roKorinde, novatsvene vese vari mudunhu rese roAkaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Mutsa norugare zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba vedu naIshe Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Anotenda Mwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Kurumbidziwa mbakuve kuna Mwari naBaba vaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, Baba votsitsi naMwari vanopasa kunyaradza kwese, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />anotinyaradza mukutambura kwedu kwese, kuitira kuti tikwanise kunyaradza avo vari pakutambura kupi nokupi, nokunyaradza kwatinonyaradziwa nako isisu naMwari. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kuwanda kwokutambudzikira Khirisitu, ndokuwandawo kunoita kunyaradziwa kwedu kuchiuya kuburikidza naKhirisitu. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Kana tichitambudzika, zvinoitihwa kunyaradziwa noruponeso renyu, uye kana tichinyaradziwa, zvinoitihwa kunyaradziwa kwenyu, kunobereka mamuri kuchiirira nomwoyo murefu pamatambudziko mabodzi bodzi yatinoita. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Tariro yedu kwamuri haigwetedzeke, ndava tinoziva kuti pamunokovehwa mumatambudziko yedu, muchakovehwawo kunyaradziwa kwedu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ndava tinodaba kuti musaye kuziva, hama, pamusoro pokutambudzika kwatidoita muEzhiya, ndava tanga tiri pakusvanikiwa kukuru, zvokuti taikwanisaba kuchiirira kana nopadiki pese, tanga toona kunge upenyu hwatopera. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Zvokuti, tidonzva kunge tapasiwa mutongo woipfa. Asi izvi zvidoitika kuti tireke kuzvivimba asi tivimbe naMwari anomutsa vadopfa, <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />adotinunura kubva panjodzi yoipfa idonyangaritsa, uye achatinunura. Paari tidoisa kugurupira kwedu kuti acharamba achimbondotinunura, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />sezvamunotibatsira nominamato yenyu. Ipopo vazinji vanodzopereka kutenda panzvimbo yedu pamaropafadzo yatinopasiwa mumhinduro yominamato yovazinji.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phauro Anosandura Urongwa Hwache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Tinodada kuti hana yedu inotipupurira kuti tidorarama zvobuya munyika, kunyanyitsa paukama hwedu nemi, hunotongewa noutsvene nokuperera zvichibva pasimba ronyasha dzaMwari aikona nouchenjeri hwonyika. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ndava tinokunyoreraiba zvinhu zvamusingakwanise kuverenga kana kunzvitsitsa. Uye ndinogurupira zvakarezvo, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />sezvamudotinzvitsitsa pashoma, muchanzvitsitsa zvidozara kuti munogona kudada naisisu sezvatichaita naimipa, pazuva raIshe Jesu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ndava ndanga ndino chokwadi nozvakarezvi, ndaida kuthanga ndauya kwamuri, kuitira kuti muwane mubatsirike kairi. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ndaida kuti ndikubvakachirei ndichienda kuMesodhoniya, ndozodzoka nokwamuri pakubva Mesodhoniya modzondibatsira pahwendo hwangu kuJudhiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Pandidoronga zvakarezvi, yanga yari manyemwe chere? Kana kuti ndinoita urongwa hwangu nonzira yonyika, ndidoteya kuti, “Inde” na “Neye” panguwa ibodzibodziyo? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Sekuvimbika kudoita Mwari, shoko redu kwamuri harisi “Inde” na “Neye,” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />ndava Mwanakomana waMwari, Jesu Khirisitu, adoparidziwa pakati penyu, nainini naSirivhanasi naTimoti, anga asiri “Inde” na “Neye,” asi maari anondova “Inde” pesepa. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ndava hazvinei nokuwanda kwozvivimbiso zvidoitiwa naMwari, zvinondova “Inde.” Saka kuburikidza naKhirisitu tinoti, “Ameni” tichipasa mbiri kuna Mwari. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Mwari ndiye anotisimbisa isisu naimimi muna Khirisitu. Adotisarura, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />nokuisa chisimbiso chache patiri chokunangidza kuti tiri vache adotipasa Mweya wache mumwoyo yedu sechibatiso chozvinhu zvichauya.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ndinototi Mwari ndiye pfakazi yangu pakurekera kuuya kuKorinde kwandidoita, ndidoisa upenyu hwangu panjodzi, kwaiva kukuitirai tsitsi. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Aikona kukutongerai pakutenda kwenyu, asi tinoshanda nemi kuitira mufaro wenyu, ndava munomira zvidosimba pakutenda kwenyu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ndava ndidoita pfungwa yokuti ndireke kuita kumwe kukubvakachirai kunokusuwisai. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ndava kana ndikakusuwisai, mbani achandipasa mufaro, kunze kwowakareyo wandasuwisa? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Uye ndidonyora daipo, kuitira kuti kana ndauya ndireke kusuwisiwa naivo vanofanira kundifadza, ndava ndinochokwadi nemi mese, kuti mufaro wangu uchava mufaro wenyu mese. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ndava ndidokunyorerai ndiri pakutambudzika kukuru nokunetseka kwomwoyo nomisodzi mizinji, zvisiri zvokukudzimbai asi kuti muzive kukura kworudo randinaro kwamuri.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuregerera Mutadzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Asi kana pano adokonzera mahwadzo, adodzimbaba inini pasinai kuingidzira asi kutoti adodzimba imimi mese. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Kumunhu adodaiyu kuranga ikoku kworuzinji kudokwana, <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />saka munotofanira kuchimuregerera momunyaradza, kuti areke kusuwa zvokutoora mwoyo. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Nokudaro ndinokumbira kuti musimbise kamu rudo renyu kwaari. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ndava chakarechi ndochikonzero chandidonyorera, kuti ndikuedzei ndizive kana muchiteerera pazvinhu zvese. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Wese wamunoregerera, neniwo ndinomuregerera. Zvandidoregerera, kana pano chaida kuregerehwa, ndidoregerera pamberi paKhirisitu nondava yenyu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kuti Sathani areke kuva nochaanowana patiri, ndava tinoziva mambere yache.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chido chaPhauro paTiroasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Pandidouya kuTiroasi koparidza vhangeri raKhirisitu, ndichiwana Ishe vadondizururira musuwo, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />handinai kudekharika mupfungwa ndava kwakareko handinai kuwana hama yangu Tito. Saka ndidovagoneka ndichienda kuMesodhoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukunda Muna Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Asi Mwari mbaatendewe, iye anogara achititungamira mukukunda muna Khirisitu, uye kuburikidza naisisu anoparadzira kwese kwese hwema hwokumuziva. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ndava kuna Mwari tiri hwema hudonaka hwaKhirisitu kuna ivo vari kuponesewa nokuno avo vari kuparara, <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />kuno umwe tiri hwema hwoipfa, kuno umwe tiri hwema hwoupenyu. Mbani anokwanisa basa ridodai? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ndava tidosiyana novazinji, vanopfuma noshoko raMwari, asi nokuti Mwari adotituma tinotaura zvidoperera pamberi pache sevaranda vaKhirisitu.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Varanda voChibvumirano Chitsva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Tiri kuthangisa kamu kuzvipupurira chere? Kana kuti tinoda, sezvinoita vamwe, tsamba dzokupupurira dzinouya kwamuri kana dzinobva kwamuri? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Imipa pachenyu ndimi tsamba yedu idonyohwa mumwoyo medu, inozikana nokuverengewa novanhu vese. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Munonangidza kuti muri tsamba inobva kuna Khirisitu idosvitsiwa nesu, isinai kunyorewa noingi asi noMweya waMwari mupenyu, aikona pamahwendefa yomabhwe asi pamahwendefa yomwoyo yovanhu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Chakarecho ndicho chivimbo chatinacho kuna Mwari. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Hakusi kuti isisu pachedu tidokodzera kuti tive nochatingaite, asi kukodzera kwedu kunobva kuna Mwari, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />iye adotikwanisa kuti tive vashumiri vochibvumirano chitsva, chisiri chomutemo udonyohwa asi choMweya, ndava mutemo udonyohwa unobaya, asi Mweya unopasa upenyu.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Zvino kana ushumiri hudouyisa ipfa, hwomabhii yadotemewa pamabhwe, hudouya nokubhwinya, zvokuti vaIzirairi vadotadzirira kunangara chiso chaMozisi kana nepo kuyetima kwacho kwaidzopera, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />ko ushumiri hwoMweya hungaveba nokuyetima kukuru nai? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ndava kana ushumiri hunouyisa mhosva huchiyetima, ko kuyetima kwoushumiri hunouyisa kururama kudokungudzitsaba? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ndava icho chaiyetima chatsinzinirafuti nondava yokuyetima kunochikunda. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ndava kana chaipfuruka chidouya nokuyetima, chisingapfuruke chinofanira kuva nokuyetima kudonyanyitsa.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Sezvo tino tariro idodai, tinokushinga kudosimba. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Hatinai kuita kunge Mozisi, waiisa jira pachiso chache kuti vaIzirairi vareke kuona magumo yokuyetima kwaipera. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Asi pfungwa dzavo dzidogomhara, kusvikira nasi, kana vachiverenga chibvumirano chakare jira ribodzi bodziro harinai kukunduhwa, ndava muna Khirisitu chete ndimo marinobisiwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Inde, kusvika nasi pese panoverengewa Mozisi jira ridondofuka pfungwa dzavo, <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />asi kana munhu watendeukira kuna Ishe jira rinobisiwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Zvino Ishe Mweya, uye pano Mweya waIshe pano kusungunuka. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Uye tese, nozviso zvisinai kufugiwa, tinonangidza kubhwinya kunobva kuna Ishe anova Mweya, anotisandura kuti tifanane nomufananidzo wache tobva panokumwe kubhwinya tichipinda pano kumwe, zvichibva kunaIshe anova Mweya.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Pfuma yoPamweya muMarongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nokudaro, zvatinoushumiri hwakarehu notsitsi dzaMwari, hatiori mwoyo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Tidoramba zvinonyadzisa zvonzira dzokabisira, tinoramba kuita mambere kana kutsautsira shoko raMwari, asi tinoisa chokwadi pachenu, hana yomunhu wese ichitambira kuzvipupurira kwedu pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Uye kana vhangeri redu ridosvisvika, ridondosvisvika chete kuna ivo vari kuparara. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Kwavari mwari wonyika ino adopofomadza pfungwa dzovasingatende, kuti vareke kuona chiedza chovhangeri rokubhwinya kwaKhirisitu, anova iye mufananidzo waMwari. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ndava hatizviparidzi isu pachedu, asi Jesu Khirisitu saIshe, uye isisu sevaranda venyu nokuda kwaJesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ndava Mwari adoti, “Chiedza mbachivhenekere kubva murima,” ndiye adovhenekera mumwoyo medu kuti atipase chiedza chokuziva kubhwinya kwaMwari kuri pachiso chaKhirisitu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Asi pfuma iyi tinayo mumidziyo yoivhu, kunangidza mukungudziro woukuru hwomasimba kuti yanobva kuna Mwari aikona kwatiri. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Tinotambudziwa nonzira dzese, asi hatinai kuthachuriwa, kushungurudziwa, asi tisingapere tariro, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />tinotambudziwa, asi tisinai kusiiwa, tinongwoshehwa pasi asi tisinai kuparadziwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Nguwa yese tinotakura mumuviri wedu ipfa yaJesu, kuitira kuti upenyu hwaJesu hunangidziwe mumuviri wedu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ndava isisu vapenyu tinogara tichiisiwa paipfa nokuda kwaJesu, kuitira kuti upenyu hwaJesu huratidziwe mumuviri wedu unopfa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Nokudaro ipfa inobata matiri, asi upenyu hunobata mamuri.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Sezvo tino mweya mubodzi bodziyo wokutenda sezvidonyohwa mugwaro, “Ndinotenda, ndokusaka ndidotaura,” naisisuwo tinotenda, saka tinotaura, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Nondava yokuti tinoziva kuti iye adomutsa Ishe Jesu kuvadopfa achatimutsawo naJesu achitiisa pamberi pache pabodzi naimimi. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ndava zvese zvinoitiwa nondava yenyu, kuitira kuti mutsa padzinosvitsiwa kuvanhu vazinji dziingidzire kupereka kutenda kukubhwinya kwaMwari.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kurarama noKutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Saka hatiori mwoyo. Kana munhu wedu wokunze achiperezeka zvache, munhu wedu womukati anovandudziwa zuva nozuva. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ndava kutambudzika kwedu kwonguwa ino kudoreruka kuri kutiendesa pakubhwinya kusingapere kuno chiremera chinokunda zvese. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ndava hatinangare kuzvinhu zvinooneka, ndava zvinooneka nzvonguwa idiki, asi zvisingaoneke nzvarini narini.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ndava tinoziva kuti kana dumba unova muviri wopanyika watidogara mauri kana waparadziwa, tino chivakwa chinobva kuna Mwari, imba yokusingapere kudenga, isinai kuitiwa nomanja yovanhu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Parizvino tiri mudumba rino tinotsinda, tichisuva kusimidziwa musha wokudenga, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />kuti tikasimidziwa nawo tireke kudzowanika tiri pedzi. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ndava tichiri mumba rino, tinotsinda nokuremehwa, ndava hatidi kuti tisunhuriwe, asi kuti tisimidziwe nomuviri wokudenga, kuitira kuti chinopfa chimedzewe noupenyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Mwari ndiye adotinhadzirira chinhu chakarechi, nokutipasa Mweya sechibatiso.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Saka nguwa dzese tino kurudziro idozara, tichiziva kuti patinenge tichiri mumba imo mumuviri hatisi kuna Ishe, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />ndava tinotekaira nokutenda, aikona nokuona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Tino kurudziro idozara, tinotoda kubirika mumuviri kuti tive kumusha naIshe. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Saka chinotova chinangwa chedu kuti timufadze zvisinei kuti tiri mumba mumuviri kana kuti tabirika makaremo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ndava tese tinofanira kuratidziwa pamberi pochigaro chaKhirisitu chokutonga, kuti umwe noumwe atambire zvaadoita achiri mumuviri zvingave zvidonaka kana zvidoipa.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukama naMwari Kuburikidza naKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Sezvo, tichiziva kuti kucha Ishe kuita tini, tinoedza kupenzveredza vanhu, asi zvatiri zvinozikana naMwari, futi ndinovimba kuti zvinozikanawo nohana dzenyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Hatisi kuzvipupurira kamu kwamuri asi tiri kukupasai mukana wokuti mudade nesu, kuti mugone kupindura avo vanodada nozvinooneka vasingadade nozvavari mumwoyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ndava kana tichipenga, nzvaMwari, kana tisingapenge, nzvenyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ndava rudo raKhirisitu rinotisukumidza, ndava tinotendesewa kuti mubodzi adopfira vese, saka vese vadopfa. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Uye adopfira vese, kuti vanorarama vareke kudzozviraramira asi vararamire iye adopfa nokuda kwavo achibva wamutsiwa kamu.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Kubva zvino, nokudaro hatichaona munhu nomaonero yonyika, kana zvedu taimboona Khirisitu nomaonero yonyika, hatichamuona daro. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Saka kana munhu wava muna Khirisitu, wava chisikwa chitsva, zvokare zvapfuura, chokwadi, zvitsva zvauya. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Zvese izvi zvinobva kuna Mwari, uyo adotiyananisa kwaari kuburikidza naKhirisitu achibva watipasa ushumiri hwokuyananisa, <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />ndiko kuti, muna Khirisitu Mwari wanga achiyananisa nyika naiye, asingaverengere vanhu kutadza kwavo. Achibva watituma noshoko rokuyananisa. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Saka tiri vamiririri vaKhirisitu, Mwari searikupereka chikumbiro chache kuburikidza naisisu. Tinokukumbirai nokuda kwaKhirisitu, kuti yananisiwai naMwari. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Mwari adoita kuti uyo wanga asinai chitadzo ave chitadzo nondava yedu, kuti maari tive kururama kwaMwari.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Sevashandi pabodzi naMwari, tinokukumbirai kuti mureke kutambira mutsa dzaMwari mahara. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ndava iye anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Panguwa idofanira ndidokunzva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">ndidokubatsira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">pazuva roruponiso.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Nangara, zvino ndiyo nguwa idofanira, nangara, nasi ndiro zuva roruponiso.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Tinoisaba mugwetso munzira yomunhu, kuti pareke kuva nochipomehwa chinowanika paushumiri hwedu, <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />asi sevaranda vaMwari tinozvipupurira nonzira dzese: kuburikidza nokutsungirira kukuru, mukutambudzika, mukuomehwa, munhamu, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />mukurohwa, mukuisiwa mutorongo, mubongozozo, mukushanda zvidooma, mukusaenzera hope, nomunzara. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Mumwoyochena, mukunzvitsitsa, mumwoyo murefu, mukunaka, muMweya Mutsvene, nomurudo rudoperera, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />mukutaura chokwadi, nomusimba raMwari, tino zvombo zvokururama kuruoko roruji norubose, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />mukukudziwa nomukuzvidziwa, mukutauhwa zvidonaka nozvidoipa. Tinobatiwa sevanyengeri, asi tiri vochokwadi, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />kunge tisingazikane, isu tichizikana chaizvo, setiri kupfa, asi tiri kurarama, tichirohwa asi tisingabaiwe, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />kunge tinosuwa, asi tichifara nguwa dzese, kunge varombo asi tichipfumisa vazinji kunge tisinai chatinacho, asi tino zvese.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Miromo yedu inotaura chokwadi kwamuri imipa vaKorinde, mwoyo yedu idozururihwa imipa. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Nhisuba tinoganhura rudo redu kwamuri, asi kuti ndimi munoganhura rudo renyu kwatiri. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ndinotaura kwamuri sekuvana vangu, zururitsaiwo mwoyo yenyu kwatiri.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo paZvifananidzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Rekai kubopewa pajoki ribodzi novasingatende. Nokuti kubatana rudzii kuri pakati pokururama nouipi? Kana kuyanana hwai kuri pachiedza norima? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kuyanana kwei kuri pakati paKhirisitu najabhurosi? Kana iye mutendi anofanana chii noasingatende? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Kubvumirana hwai kuripo pakati poimba yaMwari nozvifananidzo? Ndava tiri imba yaMwari mupenyu, sezvidoreva Mwari achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Ndichagara mavari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">nokufamba pakati pavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">ini ndichava Mwari wavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ivo vachava vanhu vangu.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Nokudaro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">birikai pakati pavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">mupararane navo,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="2CO 6:17">Ndizvo zvinoreva Ishe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Rekai kubata chinotsambwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ini ndichakutambirai.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">ndichava Baba venyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">imimi muchava vanakomana novanasikana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="2CO 6:18">Ndizvo zvinoreva Ishe Womasimba yese.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Vadikani vangu, sezvo tino zvivimbiso zvakarezvi, mbatizvisukei kubva patsambwa yese inosvipisa muviri nomweya, tiite utsvene hudokwana mukucha Mwari.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufaro waPhauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Tizururirei mwoyo yenyu, hapanai watidotadzira, hapanai watidoondomora, hapanai watidophonyedza. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Izvi handizvinyairire kukupasai mhosva, ndava ndambonyaira kare kuti muri mumwoyo yedu, tinopfa pabodzi nokurarama pabodzi. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ndino chivimbo chikuru nemi, ndinodada nemi zvikuru, ndinokurudzihwa chaizvo. Pamatambudziko yedu yese, mufaro wangu udopindiridza.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ndava kana patidouya kuMesodhoniya, tanga tisinai zororo asi taitambudziwa pesepese - kuhwisiwa kuri kunze, kucha kuri mukati. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Asi Mwari, anonyaradza vadotsikirihwa, adotinyaradza nokuuya kwaTito, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />aikona nokuuya kwache kwega asi nokunyaradza kwaadonyaradziwa kwaadowana kwamuri, adotinyepa chisuvo chenyu, kurira kwenyu, noshungu dzenyu pamusoro pangu, zvokuti ndidokungudza kufara.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Kana zvazvene ndidokusuwisai notsamba rangu, handikunguri nazvo (kana zvazvene ndidozvidemba), ndava ndinoona kuti tsamba rakarero ridokusuwisai, zvokanguwa kadiki chete. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Zvino, ndinofara, aikona nochikonzero chokuti mudosuwisiwa, asi nokuti kusuwa kwenyu kudokupasai kupinduka, ndava mudova nokusuwa kwoumwari, zvokuti hamunai chamudosaya nesu. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ndava kusuwa kwoumwari kunozvara kupinduka kunouyisa ruponiso pasinai kuzvija mwoyo, asi kusuwa kwonyika kunozvara ipfa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Chionai kuti kusuwa kwakareku kwoumwari kudouyisa chii kwamuri, kudouyisa kushingaira zvidonyanya, futi kuditsa kuti zvese zvijeke pamusoro penyu, kudodzouyisa kukaripa kudonyanya, nokunyanyitsa kuzviisa pachenu, kuva nochisuwo chikuru, kuva nohanya kudonyanya, kuzvigadzirira kuita zvidonakira vese kudonyanya! Mudonangidza kuti pamamiriro yese pano zvakarezvi hamunai mhosva.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Saka kana ndidokunyorerai zvangu, zvidoitihwaba iye nyakutadza, kana nyakutadzihwa, asi kuti shungu dzenyu pamusoro pedu dzinangidziwe pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Nokuda kwozvakarezvi tidonyaradziwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Pamusoro pokunyaradziwa kwedu tidofara maninge tichiona mufaro waTito, ndava pfungwa yache idodekhadziwa nemi mese. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ndava kwaari ndaimbodada nemi, uye hamunai kundinyadzisa. Asi semanyairihwo yazvene zvese zvanga zviri zvochokwadi, saka kudada kwedu kuna Tito kudoratidza kuvawo kwochokwadi. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Uye kukudai kwache kwatosokoka paanoyeuka kuti mese manga muchiteerera, muchimutambira nokucha nokutetemera. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ndinofara kuti ndinokwanisa kuva nochivimbo naimimi pazvese.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kupa kwomaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Tinoda kuti muzive, hama, pamusoro ponyasha dzaMwari dzidonangidziwa mukherekhe dzokuMesodhoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Nokuti mukutambudzika kwavo kukuru, vadopfachukira nomufaro uye muurombo hwavo hukuru vadozara nopfuma yokupereka zvidosununguka. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Nokuti nainini ndinovapupurira kuti vadopereka zvinoenderana nokugona kwavo, vachitopindiridza pavaigona pacho, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />vadototikumbiritsa kuti tivapase mukana wokuva nochikamu chokushumira vatsvene. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Futi havanai kundoita zvataivatarisira, asi chokuthanga vadozvipereka ivo pachavo kuna Ishe nokwatiri zviri mukuda kwaMwari. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Nokudaro tidokumbiritsa Tito kuti sezvaanga wathanga kare, mbaachipedzisawo basa ronyasha iri pakati penyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Asi sezvamunogona pazvinhu zvese pakutenda, pakunyaira, pakuziva pakuzvipira noparudo renyu kwatiri onai kuti mapawo pabasa iri ronyasha.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />handitaure izvi semurairo, asi kuti paoneke chokwadi chorudo rokuzvipira kwenyu ruchienzanisiwa norovamwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ndava munoziva mutsa dzaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, kuti zvache wanga adopfuma, asi nondava yenyu vadova murombo, kuti nourombo hwache muve vadopfuma.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Uye pachinhu ichi zano rangu randinopereka ndokuti: zvidonakitsa kwamuri kuti mupedzise zvamudothanga gore rapera aikona kundoita basi asi kuva nochido chokuita. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Asi zvino pedzisai zvamudothanga kuita, kuti shungu dzenyu dzokuda kuzviita dzienderane nokupedza kwenyu, zvichienderanawo nokukwanisa kwenyu kupereka. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ndava kana chido chiripo, chipo chinotambirika zvichienderana nozvinhu zvinomunhu, aikona maererano nozvaasinai.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Handireve kuti vamwe vanofanira kurerukihwa imipa muchiremehwa. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Asi kuti kuwana kwenyu kuyamure kusaya kwavo, nokuwana kwavo kuyamure kusaya kwenyu, kuti pave nokuenzana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa, “Uyo adounganidza zvizinji haanai chidosara, noadounganidza zvishoma hapanai chaadosaya.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito naAbiyache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Mwari mbaatendewe adoisa mumwoyo waTito wokukuitirai hanya seyandinayo kwamuri. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ndava Tito haanai kundotambira chikumbiro chedu basi, asi nochido chikuru iye pachake ari kuzvipira kuuya kwamuri. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />pabodzi naiye tiri kutumira hama inozikana maninge pakati pokherekhe dzese nondava yokuparidza kwache vhangeri, <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />aikona zvakarezvo basi, asi adosarudziwa nomakherekhe kuti afambe nesu pakutakura zvipo kwatiri kuitira kukudziwa kwaIshe pachake nokunangidza chido chedu chokubatsira. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Tinoda kuti pasaye anotipasa mhosva pamusoro pomafambisiro yatinoita kupa uku kudosununguka. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />ndava tidonanga kuita zvidonaka aikona pameso yaIshe chete asiwo nopameso yovanhu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Pabodzi naivo tiri kutumira hama yedu watidoedza kazinji tikawana kuti adozvimisira nonzira dzizinji, iye manje watoingidzika pazviri nondava yochivimbo chikuru chaanacho mamuri. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Kana ari Tito, mabiyangu futi mushandibiyangu pakukushumirai, kana dziri hama dzedu, vamiririri vomakherekhe, mbiri mbaive yaKhirisitu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nokudaro nangidzai vanhu ava chiratidzo chorudo pamberi pomakherekhe kuti vanhu vaone chikonzero chokudada kwedu nemi.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ruyamuro kuVatendi Varombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Zvino kana uri mupiro kuvatsvene ndingakunyorereiba pamusoro pozvakarezvo, <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ndava ndinoziva kugadzirira kwenyu, kwandinodada nako kukherekhe dzokuMesodhoniya, ndichivanyepa kuti imimi vokuAkaya manga mudotogadzirira kubva pagore ridopera, uye shungu dzenyu dzokupa dzidomutsa vazinji vavo. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Asi ndiri kutumira hama kuitira kuti kudada kwedu nemi kurege kusaya basa, asi muve vadogadzirira, sezvandidoreva kuti muchaita. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Mbazvireke kudzoti kana ndauya novokuMesodhoniya ndowana musinai kugadzirira, tireke kunyara nokusaya chokureva pamusoro penyu isu tanga tino chivimbo. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Saka ndidoona zvidokodzera kugara ndakumbira hama kuti dzindithangire kuuya kwamuri, kuti pagare pava nourongwa hwochivimbiso chamudoita, kuti chigadzirihwe sechipo, kusiri kupa kwokusukumidziwa asi kupa nochido.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Yeukai kuti: adojara zvishoma anokohwawo zvishoma, noadojara zvizinji anokohwawo zvizinji. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Munhu wese mbaape sezvaadofunga mumwoyo mache, asingazvije mwoyo kana kusukumidziwa, ndava Mwari anoda anopereka nomufaro. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Uye Mwari anogona kukupasai ropafadzo rese ridowanda, kuti pazvinhu zvese nopanguwa dzese muve nozvidokwana zvichiwanziwa pakuita basa rese ridonaka. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Iye adoparadzira zvipo zvache kuvarombo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">kururama kwache kunogara nokusingapere.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Iye anopasa mujari mbeu nozingwa kuti chive chokuja achakupasai mbeu nokuingidzira goho renyu nondava yokuita kwenyu zvidorurama. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Muchapfumisiwa pazvese kuti mumbogara muchipereka, kuti kuburikidza nomatiri kupereka kwenyu kuvikire Mwari nhendo.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />ndava kuitiwa kwoushumiri hwakarehu hworuyamuro kunopereraba pakundozazisa kusaya kwovatsvene asiwo kunopfachukira nonhendo dzizinji kuna Mwari. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Nondava youchapupu hunonangidziwa noushumiri hwakarehu, Mwari acharumbidziwa nokuteerera kwenyu kwopupura vhangeri raKhirisitu, uye nokupa kwenyu zvidowanda kwavari novamwe vese, <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />pavanenge vachikusuvai nokukunamatirai, nondava yokushamisa kwonyasha dzinoshamisa dzamunadzo muna Mwari. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Mwari mbaatendewe nokuda kwochipo chache chisingatsanangurike!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Phauro Anovharidzira Ushumiri Hwache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Inipano Phauro pachangu, ndinokukumbiritsai, nounyoro nokupfava kwaKhirisitu, wakareni adoreruka kana ndidonangarana naimimi, asi ndidoshinga kwamuri kana ndisipo! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ndinokukumbirai kuti kana ndavapo ndireke kudzoita ushingi hwandinovimba kuti ndichanangidza vamwe vanotiona setinoita nomutoo wonyika. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ndava kunyange tichirarama munyika tinohwaba hondo yonyika, <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />ndava zvombo zvohondo yedu nzvonyikaba asi nzvomasimba youmwari yanoparadza nzvimbo dzomasimba yovavengi nonharo dzomabhwodo, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />tinokoromorera pasi mhoka nokuva nomutindi kwese zvinopesana nokuziva Mwari, tichitapa mufungo wese nokuuisa pakuteerera Khirisitu, <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />tidozvigadzirira kuranga kusateerera kwese, kana kuteerera kwenyu kuchinge kwakwaniswa.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Nangarai zviri pamberi pomaziso yenyu. Kana pano munhu ano chokwadi kuti ngwaKhirisitu, kana naisisuwo. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ndava kana zvazvene ndichizvirumbidza pashoma pamusoro poukuru hwedu, hwatidopasiwa naIshe kuti tikuvakhei aikona kukukoromorai, ndinonyadzisiwaba. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ndinodaba kuita kunge ndiri kukuchichidzirai nomatsamba yangu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ndava vanoti, “Matsamba yache yano chiremera futi yano simba, asi paunhu hwache adoneta, nokunyaira kwache kudotonhora. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Vanhu vakarevo mbavanzvitsitse kuti zvatinonyaira nomatsamba tisipo, ndozvatinoita tiripo.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Zvisiri zvokuti tinotsvaga kuzvibatanidza kana kuzvienzanisa novamwe vanozvirumbidza vega. Asi kana vachizvipima pachavo, nokuzvienzanisa pachavo, varikuita zvidopusa. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Asi tinozvirumbidzaba zvidopindiridza, asi tichaganhurira patidotemehwa naMwari, kuti tisvike kwamuri. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ndava tinopindiridzaba kuzvitambanudza, kunge tisati tasvika kwamuri, ndava nhisu vokuthanga kuuya kwamuri novhangeri raKhirisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Tinozvirumbidzaba zvokupindiridza mugano, pamusoro pobasa ridoitiwa novamwe; asi kugurupira kwedu mhwokuti kutenda kwedu kuingidzike, nzvimbo yedu pakati penyu iingidzike zvidonyanya. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Kuitira kuti tiparidze vhangeri munyika dziri kumberi kwenyu, tisingazvirumbidze nobasa ridoitiwa kare kudzimwe nzvimbo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />“Anozvirumbidza, mbaazvirumbidze muna Ishe.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ndava anozvipfakazira ndiyeba anotambihwa, asi anotambihwa nguye anopfakazihwa naIshe,<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Phauro noNhumwa Dzomabhwodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ndaida kuti mundiitire mwoyo murefu pashoma paudzemwa hwangu. Tondiitirai mwoyo murefu wacho! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ndinokunzvirai chanje youmwari, ndava ndidokukonzerai Khirisitu kuti ndikusvitsei semusikana adochena kumurume wache mubodzi anova Khirisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Asi ndinocha kuti sezvo nyoka idonyengedza Evha nomambere yayene, pfungwa dzenyu dzingataike kubva pakuperera kwomwoyo udochena muna Khirisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ndava kana umwe akauya achiparidza umwe Jesu adosiyana nowatinoparidza, kana kukutambidzai mweya udosiyana nowamudotambira, kana kukugamuchidzai rimwe vhangeri risiri ramudogachira, munotozviitira mwoyo murefu udokwana.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ndinofunga ndiriba mudiki wokupedzisira panhumwa vadokudzitsiwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Kana zvazvo ndisiri shasha pakutaura, asi ndinoziva idozviisa pachenu kwamuri nonzira dzese.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ndidoita chitadzo nai pakuzvibata uyanga kuitira kuti mukwiridzihwe, ndava ndidoparidza vhangeri raMwari pasinai chamaibhadhara? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Ndidopamba dzimwe kherekhe nokutambira kwandaiita rutsigiro kubva kwadziri kuitira kuti ndigone kukushumirai. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Uye pandaiva nemi ndiri pakusaya, handinai wandidoremedza, ndava zvandaisaya ndidozvipasiwa nohama dzidobva kuMesodhoniya. Saka ndidoreka uye ndicharekera kukuremedzai nomutoo upi zvawene. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Sekuvapo kwochokwadi chaKhirisitu mandiri, kuzvirumbidza kwangu uku hakusi kudzonyaradziwa mumatunhu yoAkaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Nondava yei? Indava yokuti ndinokudaiba chere? Mwari anoziva kuti ndinokudai!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Uye zvandinoita ndicharamba ndichizviita, kuitira kuti ndigwatidze kutaura kwoavo vanoda kutaura vachizvirumbidza kuti vanoshanda zvidofanana nozvatinoita. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Ndava vanhu vakarevo nhumwa dzomabhwodo, mbashandi vanonyengera, vanozvisandura kunge nhumwa dzaKhirisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Uye zvinoshamisaba, ndava naiye Sathani anozvisandura sengirozi yochiedza. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Saka hazvishamise kana varanda vache vachizvisandurawo sevaranda vokururama. Magumo yavo yachaenderana nozviito zvavo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutambudzikira uNhumwa kwaPhauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ndinodzokerera, mbaparege kuva nomunhu anofunga kuti ndiri dzemwa, kana zviri izvo zvamunofunga kuti naininiwo ndizvirumbidzewo pashoma. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />(Zvokuzvirumbidza nokuzvitenda zvandiri kunyaira ndinozvinyairaba zvichibva kuna Ishe asi fanike ndiri dzemwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Sezvo vazinji vachizvirumbidza nomutoo wonyika, naininiwo ndichazvirumbidza). <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ndava munofarira kuita mwoyo murefu nomadzemwa, sezvo imipa muri vadochenjera! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ndava munoita mwoyo murefu kana munhu achikuitai varanda, kana kukuphonyedzai, kana kukutsotsai, kana akazvikudza, kana kukurovai nombama. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ndinozvishora, regai ndidaro, tanga tidovhuwa maninge pazvakarezvo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Chese munhu chaangade kuzvirumbidza nacho - ndinotaura kunge dzemwa - naininiwo ndinozvirumbidza nacho. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ivo mbaHebheru chere? Kana nainini. MbaIzirairi chere? Naininiwo. Mbana vaAbhurahamu chere? Naininiwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Mbaranda vaKhirisitu chere? Ndiri kunyaira kunge ndinopenga asi ndiri muranda ari hasa kukunda ivo! Ndidoshanditsa, ndidoisiwa mutorongo kazinji, ndidorohwa kasingaverengeke, kusvika pakuda kupfa kazinji. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Kashano ndidoshapuriwa nomaJudha shamhu makumi matatu nodzipfemba. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ndidorohwa notsvimbo katatu, ndokudzotemewa nomatombo kabodzi. Ndidodzoita tsaona nochikepe katatu, nokudzopedza masikati nousiku ndiri mumvura. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ndaimbondoita hwendo, ndichiita njodzi patuhwizi, njodzi kumakororo, njodzi pavanhu vokwangu, njodzi pano vodzimwe Ndudzi, njodzi muguta, njodzi mugwenga, njodzi pagungwa, njodzi pahama dzokunyepera. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ndidoshanda ndichitambudzika futi kadowanda handinai kuenzera, ndidoziva kuva nonzara nokuva nonyota, ndidogara ndisingaje kadowanda, ndaitonhohwa futi ndaigara ndiri pedzi. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kunze kwozvakarezvi, ndinonetseka mazuva ese nokuva nohanya pamusoro pokherekhe dzese. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Mbani adovhuwa, ini handinai kuvhuwa? Mbani anowisiwa muchivi, inini ndotadza kushushikana?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Kana ndichifanira kuzvirumbidza, ndichazvirumbidza pazvinhu zvinonangidza kuvhuwa kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Mwari naBaba vaIshe Jesu, iye anorumbidziwa nokusingapere, anoziva kuti ndinobhwodokaba. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Mutongi waiva pasi paMambo Aresitasi adochengetedza guta roDhamasiko kuti vandisunge, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />asi ndidoburutsiwa nopafafitera pamadziro ndiri mudengu, ndikapunyuka mujanja rache.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Chiono noKuzururihwa kwaPhauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ndinofanira kuzvirumbidza, kana pasinai chazvinowanisa, ndichaenda mberi nokubata zviratidzo nozvidozaruhwa zvaIshe. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ndinoziva munhu muna Khirisitu uyo makore gumi nomanai adobvutiwa achikwidziwa kudenga rochitatu - kuti wanga ari mumuviri kana kunze kwomuviri ndinozivaba, Mwari anoziva. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ndinoziva kuti munhu wakareyu - zvokuti wanga ari mumuviri kana kunze kwomuviri ndinozivaba, Mwari anoziva - <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />iyeyu adobvutiwa achiendesewa muPharadhaisi ndokunzva zvinhu zvisinganyairike, zvisinai kubvumihwa kuti munhu azvinyaire - <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Pamusoro pomunhu wakareyu ndinozvirumbidza, asi inini pachangu ndinozvirumbidzaba, kunze kwokuvhuwa kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kana ndikada kuzvirumbidza, ndingaveba dzemwa, ndava ndinenge ndichitaura chokwadi. Asi ndichasiyana nazvo, kuti pareke kuva noanofunga zvidopindiridza pamusoro pangu kukunda zvaanoona kana kunzva kubva kwandiri.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Kuti kuwanda kwozvidozaruhwa kureke kundisasura ndichizvikudza, ndidopasiwa munzva mumuiri wangu, nhume yaSathani, kuti indipfuwise, ndireke kusasuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Katatu kese ndidokumbira Ishe pamusoro pozvakarezvi, kuti zvibirike kwandiri, <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />asi adoti kwandiri, “Mutsa dzangu dzidokukwanira, ndava mukuvhuwamo masimba yangu ndimo mayanokwanisiwa.” Ndichatoingidzira kuzvirumbidza nokuvhuwa kwangu, kuti simba raKhirisitu rigare mandiri. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Nondava yaKhirisitu, ndinofarira kuvhuwako ndipo, kubatiwa uyanga, nhamu, kutambudziwa, nonyatwa, ndava pandinenge ndidovhuwa, ndipo pandinenge ndidosimba.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hanya yaPhauro kuvaKorinde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ndiri kuita kunge dzemwa asi ndimi mudondimanikidza kudaro! Ndaifanira kupupurihwa naimimi. Ndava handisi mudiki kunhumwa vakuru, kana zvangu ndisiri chinhu. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Zviratidzo zvokuva nhumwa dzochokwadi zvidoitiwa pakati penyu nomwoyo murefu udonyanyitsa, pazviratidzo nozvishamiso nominana. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ndava chii chidoitihwa dzimwe kherekhe chamusinai kuitihwa, kunze kwokuti inini pachangu handinai kukuremedzai? Ndiregererei uyanga hwakarehwo!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Zvino ndidogadzirira kuuya kwamuri kochitatu, ndisiri mutoro kwamuri, ndava ndinodaba zvinhu zvenyu, asi ndinoda imimi. Pamusoro pozvese mbanaba vanofanira kuchengeta vabereki vavo, asi kuti vabereki ndivo vanochengeta vana. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Saka ndichafarira kuparadza zvandinazvo kana kutopedzewa inini wacho nokuda kwomweya yenyu. Manje kana ndichikuditsai, inini ndini ndodiwa pashoma nai? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Asi sezvazviri kuti handinai kukuremedzai, munoti ndanga ndidochenjera, zvokuti ndidokubatai nomambere. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ndinganzi ndidokubatai nomambere chere ndichikubiridzirai kuburikidza novandidotuma kwamuri! <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ndidokumbira Tito kuuya kwamuri uye ndidomutuma pabodzi nohama. Ko Tito adokuitai dzawira mutsvanda chere? Hatinai nai kuita nomweya mubodzi bodziyo? Hatinai kutora matanho mabodzi bodziyo?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Pesepa manga muchifunga chere kuti tanga tichizvidairira kwamuri? Panga pari pamberi paMwari pataitaura tiri muna Khirisitu, kuitira kukuvakhai, vadikani. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ndava ndinocha kuti kabanga ndingauye ndikakuwanai musiri zvandinoda, nemiwo muchindiwana ndisiri zvamunoda, pachidzova nobopoto, chanje, ukari, makundano, kunyombana, makuhwa, kunyegera, nokupandukirana. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ndinocha kuti pandinouya kamu Mwari wangu angandinyadzise pamberi penyu, ndichidzorira vazinji vadotadza kare vachireka kupinduka patsambwa, paupombwe nokumbondoita utsambwa hwopabonde.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo yoKupedzisira noKumoresana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Iyi ndiyo nguwa yochitatu yandiri kuuya kwamuri. Nyaya yese inofanira kusimbisiwa nozvapupu zviiri kana zvitatu. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ndidoyambira avo vadotadza kare novamwe vese, uye ndinovayambira izvozvino ndisipo dai, kunge zvandidoita ndichiripo pahwendo hwangu hwochipiri, kuti ndikadzouya kamu handisi kuvavharidzira, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />sezvo murikuda umboo hwokuti Khirisitu ari kutaura mandiri. Adovhuwaba pakubata nemi, asi ano simba mamuri. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ndava nokuvhuwa adorovehwa pamuchinjikwa, asi mupenyu kuburikidza nosimba raMwari. Ndava tidovhuwa maari, asi pakubata nemi tichararama naye nosimba raMwari.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Zvipasei bvunzo mega, kuti muone kana mudobatirira pakutenda kwenyu. Zviedzei mega. Munonzvitsitsaba kuti Jesu Khirisitu ari mamuri? Kunze kwokunge mudotadzirira bvunzo! <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ndinogurupira kuti muchaona kuti hatinai kukundikana. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Asi tinonamata Mwari kuti mureke kuita zvidoipa aikona kuti tioneke kunge tidogona asi kuti muite zvidonaka, kana nepo tichiita kunge tidokundikana. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ndava hapanai chatingaite chinopesana nochokwadi, asi chinotsigira chokwadi basi. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ndava tinofara kana tidovhuwa imi mudosimba. Chatinonamatira ndochokuti mukwanisiwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ndinonyora izvi ndisipo kwamuri, kuitira kuti pandinouya ndirege kuita zvoukari pakushandisa simba rangu randidopasiwa naIshe kuvaka aikona kukoromora.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Pakupedzisira, hama, ndinoti chisarai. Kohororai nzira dzenyu, inzvai chikumbiro changu, bvumiranai, garisanai murunyararo, Mwari worudo norunyararo mbaave nemi.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Moresanai nokutsvodana kutsvene. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Vatsvene vese vari kukumoresai.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Mutsa dzaIshe Jesu Khirisitu norudo raMwari nokuwadzana kwoMweya Mutsvene mbazvive nemi mese.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>